    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d413">

                <pb facs="0596" n="496" xml:id="pg496"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Mutual Guarantee (Eastern Locarno)/11:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-07-13T18:00:00+01:00">July 13, 1934—6
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 13—3:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>143. Evening press publishes communiqué and inspired editorial which indicate a
                    modification of attitude of the Italian Government regarding an Eastern Locarno
                    and practically announcing it approves the plan but withholds participation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Long</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
